Qama
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 77 DEAL OVE
OVE 5 FACE_HALF

DROUR 7 FACE_ALL
DROUR 6 FACE_ALL
DROUR 5 FACE_ALL
DROUR 3 FACE_ALL
DROUR 0 FACE_ALL
DROUR 1 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE OVE {DROUR, OVE}
DEST Empty
MOVE DROUR OVE
DEST Suit {HEARTS}
DRAW
PILE ALL OVE Size > 0
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL OVE Empty
        PILE ALL DROUR Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL DROUR Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
